{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given positive integer is a Woodall number.\n    It iteratively generates Woodall numbers until a match is found or exceeded.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        woodall_n = n * (2**n) - 1\n        if woodall_n == number:\n            return True\n        if woodall_n > number:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
