{"task_id": "Mbpp/56", "solution": "def _calculate_reverse(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the reverse of a given integer (BR2).\"\"\"\n    s = str(abs(number))\n    reversed_s = s[::-1]\n    return int(reversed_s)\ndef check(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given number is one less than twice its reverse (BR1, BR3, BR4, BR5).\"\"\"\n    reversed_number = _calculate_reverse(number)\n    return number == (2 * reversed_number) - 1"}
