{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals their length.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Extract substring digit and add to current sum\n            current_sum += int(input_string[j])\n            current_length = j - i + 1\n\n            # Compare sum of digits with length\n            if current_sum == current_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
