{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "class NewmanConwaySequence:\n    def __init__(self):\n        # Initializes the memoization cache with the base cases P(1)=1 and P(2)=1.\n        self._memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    def calculate_term(self, n: int) -> int:\n        # Returns the memoized value if the term has already been calculated.\n        if n in self._memo:\n            return self._memo[n]\n\n        # Calculates P(n) using the recursive formula for n > 2.\n        p_n_minus_1 = self.calculate_term(n - 1)\n        p_p_n_minus_1 = self.calculate_term(p_n_minus_1)\n        p_n_minus_p_n_minus_1 = self.calculate_term(n - p_n_minus_1)\n\n        result = p_p_n_minus_1 + p_n_minus_p_n_minus_1\n        self._memo[n] = result\n        return result\n_newman_conway_calculator = NewmanConwaySequence()\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth term of the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    The sequence is defined by P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, and P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n - P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    return _newman_conway_calculator.calculate_term(n)"}
