{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "def divisor(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total number of positive divisors for a given positive integer n.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of n\n    for i in range(1, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            # If i is a divisor, then n // i is also a divisor\n            if i * i == n:\n                # If i and n // i are the same (perfect square), count only once\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                # Otherwise, count both i and n // i\n                count += 2\n    return count"}
