{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "from collections import Counter\ndef validate(integer: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    Returns True if the condition holds for all digits, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_str = str(abs(integer))\n    digit_frequencies = Counter(num_str)\n\n    for digit_char, frequency in digit_frequencies.items():\n        digit_value = int(digit_char)\n        if frequency > digit_value:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
