{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the aggregate sum of digits for each number in the given list.\n    Delegates individual digit sum calculation to a helper function.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_single_sum_of_digits(number: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the sum of digits for a single integer.\n        Converts the number to its absolute string representation to sum its digits.\n        \"\"\"\n        s = 0\n        for digit_char in str(abs(number)):\n            s += int(digit_char)\n        return s\n\n    total_aggregate_sum = 0\n    for number in numbers:\n        total_aggregate_sum += _calculate_single_sum_of_digits(number)\n    return total_aggregate_sum"}
