{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "import math\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given positive integer.\"\"\"\n    total_sum_even_factors = 0\n\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of the number\n    # This efficiently finds all pairs of factors.\n    for i in range(1, int(math.sqrt(number)) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            # i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum_even_factors += i\n\n            # Find the other factor in the pair\n            other_factor = number // i\n            # If the factors are distinct (not a perfect square root), check the other factor\n            if other_factor != i:\n                if other_factor % 2 == 0:\n                    total_sum_even_factors += other_factor\n\n    return total_sum_even_factors"}
