{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_sum_natural_numbers(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the first n natural numbers.\"\"\"\n        return n * (n + 1) // 2\n\n    def _calculate_sum_cubes_natural_numbers(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers.\"\"\"\n        sum_n = _calculate_sum_natural_numbers(n)\n        return sum_n * sum_n\n\n    sum_n = _calculate_sum_natural_numbers(n)\n    sum_cubes_n = _calculate_sum_cubes_natural_numbers(n)\n\n    return sum_cubes_n - sum_n"}
