{"task_id": "Mbpp/726", "solution": "def multiply_elements(t: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the product of adjacent elements in an input tuple.\n    Returns a new tuple where each element is t_i * t_{i+1}.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(t) < 2:\n        return ()\n\n    results = []\n    for i in range(len(t) - 1):\n        results.append(t[i] * t[i+1])\n    return tuple(results)"}
