{"task_id": "Mbpp/730", "solution": "def remove_consecutive_duplicates(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes consecutive duplicate elements from a list, keeping only one instance\n    of each consecutive sequence.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    result = [input_list[0]]\n    for i in range(1, len(input_list)):\n        if input_list[i] != result[-1]:\n            result.append(input_list[i])\n    return result"}
