{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "import math\ndef lateralsurface_cone(r, h):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the lateral surface area of a cone given radius r and height h.\"\"\"\n    slant_height = math.sqrt(r**2 + h**2)\n    lsa = math.pi * r * slant_height\n    return lsa"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "def find_first_occurrence(array: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the index of the first occurrence of a number in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns -1 if the target is not found.\"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            high = mid - 1  # Try to find an earlier occurrence in the left half\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1\n            \n    return result"}
