{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(array: list, element: object) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the last position (index) of a specified element in a sorted array.\n    Uses a modified binary search to find the rightmost occurrence.\n    \"\"\"\n    last_pos = -1\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == element:\n            last_pos = mid\n            low = mid + 1\n        elif array[mid] < element:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > element\n            high = mid - 1\n    return last_pos"}
