{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "def left_rotate(number: int, count: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs a 32-bit left bit rotation on the given number.\n\n    Args:\n        number: The integer value to be rotated.\n        count: The number of positions to shift bits to the left.\n\n    Returns:\n        The integer result of the 32-bit left bit rotation.\n    \"\"\"\n    MASK = 0xFFFFFFFF\n    actual_count = count % 32\n    return ((number << actual_count) & MASK) | (number >> (32 - actual_count))"}
